# LIFE-867 (Jim, Nov 22 2026, "nightly backups"): once a day at 3:30 AM Central. Persistent, so a night the host was off runs at the next start. A backup timer only.
[Unit]
Description=LIFE OS Honcho nightly backup, 3:30 AM Central

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 03:30:00 America/Chicago
Persistent=true
RandomizedDelaySec=0

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
